<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs steady/off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs steady/off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady to $1.00 lower than Thursday's close. Demand and Supply moderate. Top $55.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    53.00-55.00</p>
<p>US 1-2    210-220 lbs    50.00-53.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-230 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-270 lbs    52.00-53.00</p>
<p>	    270-280 lbs    51.00-52.00</p>
<p>Sows steady to 2.00 lower, most decline on weights over 500 lbs. Top 52.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    42.00-47.00</p>
<p>	   over 500 lbs    50.00-52.00</p>
</text>
